      "id_str": "2096008086901113339",
      "text": "All I did was:\n1. Connect Codex to Blender MCP\n2. Paste in the concept for the game\n3. Tell Astra to use the Codex image gen skill to generate concept images of the target art style, then iterate until in-game screenshots look as close as possible to those, at 60fps\n\nSet to high",
